# Patch for flash-linear-attention (fla-core) 0.4.2, file fla/ops/cp/chunk_delta_h.py.
# Source: https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention, fla-core 0.4.2 from PyPI.
# Two triton.autotune keys name values that are not kernel arguments ("STAGE"; "BT" and
# "USE_EXP2"). Triton 3.9 (PyTorch 26.11 base) rejects such keys when fla is imported. Earlier
# Triton dropped the unknown names, so removing them keeps the same tuning keys. fla 0.5 no longer
# has these keys; remove this patch with that upgrade. Docker accepts only the original or the
# already-patched source.
